  "synonym_discrimination": {
    "words": [
      "choice-n",
      "option-n",
      "selection-n"
    ],
    "note": "**Choice** is the general word: *make a choice*, *a wide choice of food*. An **option** is one of the things you can choose, often in plans or business: *We have two options*. A **selection** is a group of things chosen or offered, often in a store: *a selection of cheeses*."
  },
